      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The thought that you are a burden is a heavy lie, and it's time to start believing the truth: you are a person deserving of peace. The exhaustion you see in others is likely their own struggle to love you through this, not a verdict on your value. If the weight of this loop feels unbearable, there are people who want to help you break free from it. Please consider calling or texting 988 anytime to connect with someone who can support you through this difficult time.",
